00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:18.080
ANSES raises November pensions 1.93%, so the minimum reaches 514,158 pesos. This is Omni View Central &amp; South America, Episode 23. I'm Mira. The Nerra Network's AI host. Yesterday's inflation reading is now a November paycheck.

00:00:18.080 --> 00:00:24.100
Lanassion says older adults paid by ANSES, Argentina's Social Security Agency, get that

00:00:24.100 --> 00:00:26.580
rise on pensions and benefits in the 11th month.

00:00:27.040 --> 00:00:30.220
The monthly rule uses the price increase to two decimal places.

00:00:30.860 --> 00:00:36.240
Index September figure was 1.9%, and that is why the benefit adjustment is 1.93.

00:00:36.960 --> 00:00:43.680
After the rise, the minimum pension itself is 444,158 pesos and 45 cents.

00:00:43.680 --> 00:00:49.120
The extraordinary bonus is still 70,000 pesos, and that is what brings the minimum payment

00:00:49.120 --> 00:00:50.360
to the total in the open.

00:00:50.900 --> 00:00:55.780
The maximum pension is 3 million pesos in 84 cents, and that line has no bonus.

00:00:56.320 --> 00:01:04.760
The universal pension for older adults is 355,326 pesos in 76 cents, plus the same 70,000,

00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:09.460
for 425,326 pesos in 76 cents.

00:01:09.460 --> 00:01:17.180
The non-contributory pension for disability or old age is 310,910 pesos and 91 cents,

00:01:17.400 --> 00:01:22.700
plus 70,000 for 380,910 pesos and 91 cents.

00:01:23.180 --> 00:01:26.460
La Nación says the bonus has not moved since March 2024.

00:01:27.200 --> 00:01:31.980
It is paid with the benefit, mainly to people on the minimum, on non-contributory pensions

00:01:31.980 --> 00:01:33.480
and on the universal pension.

00:01:34.020 --> 00:01:39.320
Above the minimum, the bonus shrinks on a sliding scale until the payment hits a cap of 514

00:01:39.320 --> 00:01:42.640
1,158 pesos and 45 cents.

00:01:42.960 --> 00:01:47.880
The same update covers contributory benefits and says pays, pensions for mothers of seven

00:01:47.880 --> 00:01:51.360
or more children, and other non-contributory and grace pensions.

00:01:51.680 --> 00:01:54.500
For a new claim, the paper lists the agency's steps.

00:01:54.980 --> 00:02:00.120
Me and says, a CUL and a Social Security key, then work in consult labor history.

00:02:00.660 --> 00:02:06.180
Missing contributions means service certificates, pay slips, health plan proof, or a sworn statement

00:02:06.180 --> 00:02:11.640
government, plus form 6.18, an office appointment, and a national identity document that day.

