00:02:49.020 --> 00:02:53.620
Greater Sao Paulo is the focus of a Thursday operation by the State Public Prosecutors Office,

00:02:53.980 --> 00:02:54.900
and the Federal Police.

00:02:55.540 --> 00:02:59.840
O'Globo says the target is a group suspected of shipping drugs inside appliances bought

00:02:59.840 --> 00:03:00.300
online.

00:03:00.300 --> 00:03:06.740
Investigators identified about 120 suspicious parcels addressed to three groups of people in the metro area.

00:03:07.060 --> 00:03:11.420
They are serving 14 temporary arrest warrants and 15 search warrants in the capital,

00:03:11.880 --> 00:03:19.840
South Kaitano do Sul, and Priya Grande, and also in Palhosa in Santa Catarina, and in Fasdu, Iguasu, and Pinhais in Parana.

00:03:20.260 --> 00:03:21.500
Three people were arrested.

00:03:22.020 --> 00:03:25.220
O'Globo calls them suspects, not people already convicted.

00:03:25.220 --> 00:03:30.220
The inquiry opened in September 2025 after online orders with drugs hidden in

00:03:30.220 --> 00:03:35.000
appliances were identified. Since 2024, greater Sao Paulo residents had been

00:03:35.000 --> 00:03:39.740
getting shipments of that kind, posted mainly in Fauss du Iguesu. Investigators

00:03:39.740 --> 00:03:44.360
alleged the group also moved proceeds through split transfers, cash withdrawals, and

00:03:44.360 --> 00:03:48.500
payments to third parties and to new companies with no real business. Financial

00:03:48.500 --> 00:03:52.300
reports the paper says showed movements out of line with declared income.

00:03:52.300 --> 00:03:57.340
Possible charges are drug trafficking, criminal organization, and money laundering,

00:03:57.560 --> 00:04:02.060
and CES material is still to be examined as authorities look for others and trace assets.

00:04:03.270 --> 00:04:09.210
Buenos Aires has crews inside the Central Cultural General San Martín after several years of deterioration.

00:04:09.710 --> 00:04:19.330
La Nación says the city opened a full intervention at Sarmiento 15001 to repair the structure, modernize the systems, and keep the original design.

00:04:19.330 --> 00:04:22.770
The complex is by architect Mario Roberto Alvarez.

00:04:23.090 --> 00:04:28.010
It opened on May 8th, 1970, and it covers more than 42,000 square meters.

00:04:28.550 --> 00:04:34.170
An administrative tower, a main building of theater halls, and six basements with room for 900 people.

00:04:34.710 --> 00:04:40.070
Jorge Macri, the city's head of government, said the administration is recovering a symbol of Buenos Aires,

00:04:40.510 --> 00:04:45.450
part of the city's cultural identity, and that the work should put the building back at the level of its history.

00:04:45.890 --> 00:04:47.790
Modern, safe, and open to everyone.

00:04:47.790 --> 00:04:50.390
The first stage is installations and structure.

00:04:51.010 --> 00:04:55.870
Crews are taking down old masonry, partitions and ceilings and raising new internal structures,

00:04:56.250 --> 00:04:59.530
while specialists restore the heritage facades of halls A and B.

00:05:00.070 --> 00:05:05.370
Electrical, sanitary, thermomechanical and fire protection systems are to be replaced completely.

00:05:05.970 --> 00:05:11.850
Universal access and updated evacuation rules sit in the same stage, with changes to the elevator passageways.

00:05:11.850 --> 00:05:14.750
Chirba chairs and the four-year arm chairs are to stay.

00:05:15.210 --> 00:05:17.570
New equipment is planned for workshops and offices.

00:05:18.130 --> 00:05:21.970
Later stages would add professional lighting and more efficient climate control to cut

00:05:21.970 --> 00:05:27.010
energy use, remove risks, and run the building on what the plan calls sustainable technology.

00:05:28.039 --> 00:05:32.939
The address was the main computing center for the 1983 presidential election and hosted

00:05:32.939 --> 00:05:35.419
the 76th World Interparlimentary Congress.

00:05:35.419 --> 00:05:41.459
In 1990, it held the Latin American writer's meeting, with talks by Mario Benedetti, Mario

00:05:41.459 --> 00:05:43.559
Vargas Yosa, and Jose Donoso.

00:05:44.139 --> 00:05:48.159
The project material says that when every stage is finished, a building full of those

00:05:48.159 --> 00:05:52.579
memories is meant to recover its standing, as a renewed base for national and international

00:05:52.579 --> 00:05:53.219
culture.

